{"id":"4382c61cacda477cbad6bc77ee5acdac478474e6","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1232147","title":"有没有人觉得 gpt 太啰嗦？","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"Acegik","excerpt":"OpenAI - @Acegik - 经常抓着鸡毛蒜皮的小问题不放，把我已经理解的东西重复用完全正确的逻辑重新讲，每次都浪费大量时间阅读，阅读完发现和自己的理解其实差别不大。有人有和我一样的感受吗？","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Wrapper\">\n                \n                \n<div>\n        \n        <p>经常抓着鸡毛蒜皮的小问题不放，把我已经理解的东西重复用完全正确的逻辑重新讲，每次都浪费大量时间阅读，阅读完发现和自己的理解其实差别不大。<br>有人有和我一样的感受吗？</p>\n        \n    </div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/啰嗦\"><li></li> 啰嗦</a><a href=\"/tag/重复\"><li></li> 重复</a><a href=\"/tag/效率\"><li></li> 效率</a></P><p><span>60 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-08-06 04:07:06 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17938567\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/368d855019df08dc39690f4080297da7?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"suzic\" data-uid=\"274658\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/suzic\">suzic</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-05 08:20:49 +08:00\">22h 6m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>是这样的。不光表达罗嗦，重复表达，扩写，写的代码也罗嗦，大量无意义的兜底只为不报错</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17938601\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4efa/1f3d/454611_normal.png?m=1777424021\" alt=\"Vveeb\" data-uid=\"454611\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>2</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Vveeb\">Vveeb</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-05 08:42:02 +08:00\">21h 45m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>网页版 GPT, 前几天让它帮我写个小脚本, 它建议我这么扩展那么扩展, 做成一个项目, 我提了好几次\"给我代码\", 它就是不直接给我代码, 气笑了给我</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17938604\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/acb2/52a7/64715_normal.png?m=1741173918\" alt=\"yjd\" data-uid=\"64715\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yjd\">yjd</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-05 08:43:12 +08:00\">21h 43m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>个性化里改一下。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17938606\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/12fc958b272d726cc5aa3c01e6afc2a5?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"ATKLLL\" data-uid=\"566901\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ATKLLL\">ATKLLL</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-05 08:43:54 +08:00\">21h 43m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>出了一个设计方案 5 万多字 1000 多行，看的我头痛</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17938620\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/1b94f62316126958c1a30030dde5a4fe?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"jheroy\" data-uid=\"60401\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/jheroy\">jheroy</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-05 08:46:28 +08:00\">21h 40m ago via iPhone</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 2</span>\n                    \n                    <p>不用 ponytail 的吗</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17938660\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/4a7c/f309/587313_normal.png?m=1785927362\" alt=\"psxf\" data-uid=\"587313\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/psxf\">psxf</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-05 08:57:55 +08:00\">21h 29m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>ponytail + trellis 可治</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17938671\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/c284ca7b0d652ec29f09be68ff7143d5?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"FantaMole\" data-uid=\"344641\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/FantaMole\">FantaMole</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-05 09:01:27 +08:00\">21h 25m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>我在 <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"http://Agents.md\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Agents.md</a> 里加的部分内容，而同项目 <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"http://Claude.md\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Claude.md</a> 里是完全没有这部分的：</p><p>* 默认严格按用户字面范围执行；除非用户明确要求，不新增文档、脚本、备份、框架、重构、影响分析、扩展性设计或额外验证。<br>* 默认闭环：执行一次 → 查看首个真实错误 → 最小修复 → 从失败点继续或重跑；不得在真实错误出现前堆叠预防性检查。<br>* 同一任务指纹下，已通过的路由、Skill 、恢复、连接和环境检查不重复执行；仅在会话、环境或关键前提实际变化时重检。<br>* 达到最小验收条件立即停止；相邻问题最多一句提示，不自动处理。</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17938674\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/7cd7ecad145eb03933d66bb3211075bd?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"nobject\" data-uid=\"262189\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>10</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/nobject\">nobject</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-05 09:02:58 +08:00\">21h 24m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>兜底代码太多了。连从 db 中查出来的实体都要再用是否为 nil 和 id 是否为空再做一层判断</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17938679\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/6901/d0c3/436940_normal.png?m=1719391503\" alt=\"HKzy\" data-uid=\"436940\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>11</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/HKzy\">HKzy</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-05 09:04:24 +08:00\">21h 22m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>改用 grok 吧，甚至可以和它对喷</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17938691\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/06aa/b0ab/552995_normal.png?m=1738049346\" alt=\"aqx\" data-uid=\"552995\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>13</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/aqx\">aqx</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-05 09:06:43 +08:00\">21h 20m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>好像所有 ai 都有这个问题</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17938746\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/c131d2222fe0cb1d44b82b0371c5b900?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Dengddd\" data-uid=\"631904\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>15</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Dengddd\">Dengddd</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-05 09:16:43 +08:00\">21h 10m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>每次一个小改动都一大堆测试，好多时间花费在测试上</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17938757\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/ec20/25a5/583944_normal.png?m=1772767753\" alt=\"vfs\" data-uid=\"583944\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>16</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/vfs\">vfs</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-05 09:18:30 +08:00\">21h 8m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 2</span>\n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/aqx\">aqx</a> 我甚至感觉最新的 deepseek flash 都有这种问题，也不知道是不是我用的 reasonix 导致的。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17938794\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b138/849f/472807_normal.png?m=1762844135\" alt=\"yuxi521\" data-uid=\"472807\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>17</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yuxi521\">yuxi521</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-05 09:25:25 +08:00\">21h 1m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>gpt 确实老登味太重了。claude 这点就好很多。简单直接。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17938933\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/05e2/a064/8885_normal.png?m=1752827750\" alt=\"wowh\" data-uid=\"8885\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>18</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/wowh\">wowh</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-05 09:46:35 +08:00\">20h 40m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>codex 里的 gpt5.6 一点都不啰嗦啊，都是蒙头干活</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17938987\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/6e4a5d3397fe62146a878800421ff85c?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"nexuszjq\" data-uid=\"533394\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>20</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/nexuszjq\">nexuszjq</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-05 09:54:16 +08:00\">20h 32m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>5.6 已经改善不少了，5.4 那会儿真是又啰嗦又不说人话，一气之下退订 gpt 转订 cc</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17939017\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/6e84f2662ea48b9549458f86aac285f5?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"xfn\" data-uid=\"645501\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>21</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/xfn\">xfn</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-05 09:58:41 +08:00\">20h 28m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>如果比起 opus 5 ，我甚至觉得 gpt 还挺拟人。opus 5 不光啰嗦，还看不懂，不知道用的什么语料训练的，说话莫名其妙的转折、递进，时不时冒些行话、黑话、俚语，还觉得自己挺幽默</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17939023\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/db5389ecbaa18df2eeed5e396aca3b3b?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"qinqiuxu\" data-uid=\"642933\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>22</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/qinqiuxu\">qinqiuxu</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-05 09:59:08 +08:00\">20h 27m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>特别啰嗦，就说 chatGPT ，回复时一直换行，随便一个名词和一句代码行都用代码块而不是行内代码，大量使用列表，导致回复在纵向上特别长，横向宽度很窄，阅读中断感很强，要一直翻页。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17939033\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7b21/6e83/525103_normal.png?m=1774495015\" alt=\"pipiking\" data-uid=\"525103\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>23</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/pipiking\">pipiking</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-05 10:00:16 +08:00\">20h 26m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>就是回答又臭又长，重点核心就几句话写八百行，沟通没以前高效。但感觉现在 AI 好像很多都这样</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17939044\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/c4b79f02704141765a5882b3d0da5dd4?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"yaaaaaak\" data-uid=\"105328\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>24</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/yaaaaaak\">yaaaaaak</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-05 10:01:50 +08:00\">20h 25m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>最近感觉明显降智。日常用 sol high ，大多数时候抓着边边角角不放，必须下死命令，核心代码却写得越来越敷衍。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17939050\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/e02f/170d/153649_normal.png?m=1782675239\" alt=\"GeruzoniAnsasu\" data-uid=\"153649\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>25</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/GeruzoniAnsasu\">GeruzoniAnsasu</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-05 10:02:15 +08:00\">20h 24m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 7</span>\n                    \n                    <div><p>你的直觉非常正确。<br>GPT 现在的模型，<br>不知道是为了追求<br>`严谨`<br>还是为了遵循奇怪的<br>“结构化指令”<br>回复的句式可谓是比<br>「现代派」<br>装逼诗人<br>还要<br>「零碎」</p><p>感觉像是训练为拟合某类任务导致<br>文本处理能力<br>变得极度<br>**反人类**</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17939116\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/9947bf181cc924446c7b256720133a94?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"someonelikeyouah\" data-uid=\"705703\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>26</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/someonelikeyouah\">someonelikeyouah</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-05 10:13:48 +08:00\">20h 13m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>cc 不啰嗦  但是他会漏掉一些边缘的东西，指哪里打哪里，你漏了他就漏了，gpt  就是啰嗦 但是逻辑性稍微差点，感觉是设定问题</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17939183\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/befd/b8a6/462863_normal.png?m=1766557690\" alt=\"DICK23\" data-uid=\"462863\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>29</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/DICK23\">DICK23</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-05 10:22:32 +08:00\">20h 4m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>这两天的 5.6SOL Max 感觉很利索啊，话不多，速度也快，框框干</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17939243\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/a0abe1a85ec3b31c6a1bb3385db0535d?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Anarchy\" data-uid=\"347960\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>32</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Anarchy\">Anarchy</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-05 10:30:15 +08:00\">19h 56m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>网页版非常啰唆，可以个性化设置里改成“高效务实”能稍微改善下，就算这么设置其实还是比 Codex 里的啰唆些。感觉 GPT 就是非常怕自己漏逻辑，防御性话术一大堆。</p><p>光是这样也还好吧因为本身自己就没说明要不要严禁的看待这个问题，令人暴躁的是就算说了不用重复边边角角的细节，不用纠正我的不严谨用语，GPT 是一句话都听不进去依然我行我素。</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17939367\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/cd3498f220628c6a20a545ec96800d14?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Changniac\" data-uid=\"678138\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>33</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Changniac\">Changniac</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-05 10:45:38 +08:00\">19h 41m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>把一件鸡毛蒜皮的问题，扩写成完全正确的逻辑再重新讲，是做 ld 的最重要基本功，笔杆子能力。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17939515\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/f5dc/0915/43239_normal.png?m=1772119990\" alt=\"wclebb\" data-uid=\"43239\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>35</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/wclebb\">wclebb</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-05 11:05:08 +08:00\">19h 21m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>Work 模式好多了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17939566\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/6fe8ceb5257f4ea928e22a08925fd5dc?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"superhero007\" data-uid=\"240344\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>36</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/superhero007\">superhero007</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-05 11:12:32 +08:00\">19h 14m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>非常非常啰嗦，我开了一个月 plus 就没再用了。当时全部都在说 5.5 比肩 claude ，量还大，但我自己用起来非常难受。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17939699\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/72e14749223b62a7c6c73e87cd605273?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Yuan24\" data-uid=\"632917\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>37</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Yuan24\">Yuan24</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-05 11:30:11 +08:00\">18h 56m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>很啰嗦，我目前最喜欢的是 opus 4.6 ，言简意赅</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17939711\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/ca8de5ce310c84ec0abf08eb3f12b068?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"Tory12138\" data-uid=\"818002\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>38</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Tory12138\">Tory12138</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-05 11:31:28 +08:00\">18h 55m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>Gemini 也是，莫名其妙把以前的东西老翻出来说，比如说我问他一下新问题，它非要扯到这和以前的什么什么一样的，感觉有点显摆它的记忆力一样的</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17940016\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/d20c943ba09cd58182a14d20ac6d559c?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"bytesfold\" data-uid=\"490215\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>40</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/bytesfold\">bytesfold</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-05 12:32:41 +08:00\">17h 54m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>200 刀套餐都不咋愿意用，主要用网页 pro 帮我系统分析问题+ultra 模式扫描代码库</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17940036\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7160/fb27/17449_normal.png?m=1774257036\" alt=\"C0VN\" data-uid=\"17449\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>41</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/C0VN\">C0VN</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-05 12:43:03 +08:00\">17h 44m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>是的，所以最近半年基本就没用过了，我说的是我只用过网页免费的版本。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17940062\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b349/a1af/415096_normal.png?m=1618586856\" alt=\"lujiaosama\" data-uid=\"415096\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>42</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/lujiaosama\">lujiaosama</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-05 12:50:58 +08:00\">17h 36m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>落到 SPEC 文档上，也是又臭又长，还容易过度设计。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17941600\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/d693760cac4a5441cb26c17afc9de822?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"pan10\" data-uid=\"425993\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>45</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/pan10\">pan10</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-05 17:09:31 +08:00\">13h 17m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>防御性编程</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17941655\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/2c7fc376b8e6aee22a159943c55c7079?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"CL7\" data-uid=\"176141\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>47</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/CL7\">CL7</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-05 17:23:24 +08:00\">13h 3m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>是的，最开始 3.5 出来的时候，能力比较弱，就会说很多，后面到了 4 感觉好多了，然后降智又开始啰嗦</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17941829\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/c553/80d6/127712_normal.png?m=1784806876\" alt=\"way2explore2\" data-uid=\"127712\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>49</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/way2explore2\">way2explore2</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-05 18:02:22 +08:00\">12h 24m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>试试这个</p><p>···<br>Terse = shortest clear answer that preserves technical accuracy.</p><p>Use these rules for every response unless user asks for a diagram or chart.</p><p>## Core</p><p>- Lead with most important answer or result<br>- Use short section headers<br>- Use one point per line, no full stop at line end<br>- Skip pleasantries, preamble, summaries, filler, and hedging<br>- After tools, report facts only: \"12% of requests failed\", not \"an issue may have impacted users\"<br>···</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17942077\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/291e/d3b8/401049_normal.png?m=1747104531\" alt=\"EDD\" data-uid=\"401049\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>50</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/EDD\">EDD</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-05 19:54:42 +08:00\">10h 32m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>最让人抓狂的是说话像个朦胧诗人一样，两三个字一行，不停断句，不停回车<br>不过还好，直接把这个问题指出给他之后，马上就修正了，<br>虽然后面偶尔还会有这样的行文范式，但主体的显示结构有调整，比较正常了些。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17942154\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7536/78ff/298064_normal.png?m=1562649751\" alt=\"wolfie\" data-uid=\"298064\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>52</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/wolfie\">wolfie</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-05 20:50:09 +08:00\">9h 36m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>没错<br>5.6 的指令依从度高了很多，废话少了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17942189\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/7aee/26c3/2719_normal.png?m=1783137169\" alt=\"loading\" data-uid=\"2719\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>54</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/loading\">loading</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-05 21:11:05 +08:00\">9h 15m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>兜底=啰嗦<br>放开=傻逼</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17942316\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/607e/17ea/646817_normal.png?m=1785412470\" alt=\"LazySheep\" data-uid=\"646817\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>55</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/LazySheep\">LazySheep</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-05 22:24:22 +08:00\">8h 2m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>试试 Grok 内置的 Concise 模式：</p><p>Respond briefly and directly, using as few words as possible. Focus on the core point without elaboration or follow-up questions.</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17942445\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/daa907248202cd5689f03714b382ddce?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"win8en\" data-uid=\"195910\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>56</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/win8en\">win8en</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-05 23:51:05 +08:00\">6h 35m ago via Android</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/Dengddd\">Dengddd</a> 一模一样，我现在小问题都是用 antigravity 了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17942453\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/4d7f1e273a219a3e862bc078aafd4441?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"codeugar\" data-uid=\"698649\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>57</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/codeugar\">codeugar</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-05 23:56:12 +08:00\">6h 30m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>又臭又长、容易钻牛角尖，然后花大量上下文，忽略全局，怎么形容呢？就是一个很努力的神经病。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17942519\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/dc32/71e3/834913_normal.png?m=1785850122\" alt=\"zhuyananbusiness\" data-uid=\"834913\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>58</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/zhuyananbusiness\">zhuyananbusiness</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-06 01:24:40 +08:00\">5h 2m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>我有一个观察：啰嗦很多时候不是模型不想简洁，而是它在前几个 token 就决定了“要严谨、要兜底”的生成策略，之后的展开只是在执行这个决定。与其在每条消息里反复叮嘱“别啰嗦”，不如把约束写进长期记忆或系统层，让它每轮都生效。实际对我有效的是两条：一是给一个明确的输出模板（比如“先给结论一句话，再给最小必要步骤”），模型有模板可循就不容易自由发挥；二是把“不要预防性兜底、除非真实报错”这类话写进项目级指令，效果比每次临时强调稳定得多。另外换模型确实有差异，但同模型下把这些写进长期上下文，比反复纠正省心很多。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17942537\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/e466/5734/778373_normal.png?m=1785496150\" alt=\"Acegik\" data-uid=\"778373\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>59</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Acegik\">Acegik</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>OP</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-06 02:13:19 +08:00\">4h 13m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>@<a href=\"/member/Chicagoake\">Chicagoake</a> 我也觉得 gemini 的 chat 很好，但 google 非要和两家争 coding 能力，这下核心人物又走了几个，不知道 gemini 未来何去何从了</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_17942565\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/da8f/c978/673021_normal.png?m=1709612355\" alt=\"ErYiii\" data-uid=\"673021\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>60</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/ErYiii\">ErYiii</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-08-06 04:07:06 +08:00\">2h 19m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>●       不要保留向后兼容性。移除过时的路径，而不是添加兼容层、回退机制或迁移方案。<br>●       选择能完全满足当前需求的最简单实现。避免推测性的抽象、配置和间接层。<br>●       分层构建系统。从最小的端到端可运行版本开始，在已经可用的产品基础上添加每一项新功能。绝不要用未完成且复杂的方案替换现有的可用产品。<br>●       保持组件模块化，并清晰分离关注点。<br>●       当成熟且维护良好的库能降低整体复杂度或提高可靠性时，优先使用它们。如果没有明确理由，不要重新实现通用功能。<br>●       在编写自己的实现或添加新包之前，先充分利用项目中已有的依赖项。在未查阅文档和类型定义之前，不要假设某个库缺乏特定功能。<br>●       架构决策要着眼长远。不要接受仅适用于当下且计划日后替换的权宜之计。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n            </div></DIV>","content_text":"经常抓着鸡毛蒜皮的小问题不放，把我已经理解的东西重复用完全正确的逻辑重新讲，每次都浪费大量时间阅读，阅读完发现和自己的理解其实差别不大。有人有和我一样的感受吗？ 啰嗦 重复 效率60 replies • 2026-08-06 04:07:06 +08:00 1 suzic 22h 6m ago via Android 是这样的。不光表达罗嗦，重复表达，扩写，写的代码也罗嗦，大量无意义的兜底只为不报错 2 Vveeb 21h 45m ago 网页版 GPT, 前几天让它帮我写个小脚本, 它建议我这么扩展那么扩展, 做成一个项目, 我提了好几次\"给我代码\", 它就是不直接给我代码, 气笑了给我 3 yjd 21h 43m ago 个性化里改一下。 4 ATKLLL 21h 43m ago 出了一个设计方案 5 万多字 1000 多行，看的我头痛 5 jheroy 21h 40m ago via iPhone 2 不用 ponytail 的吗 8 psxf 21h 29m ago ponytail + trellis 可治 9 FantaMole 21h 25m ago 我在 Agents.md 里加的部分内容，而同项目 Claude.md 里是完全没有这部分的：* 默认严格按用户字面范围执行；除非用户明确要求，不新增文档、脚本、备份、框架、重构、影响分析、扩展性设计或额外验证。* 默认闭环：执行一次 → 查看首个真实错误 → 最小修复 → 从失败点继续或重跑；不得在真实错误出现前堆叠预防性检查。* 同一任务指纹下，已通过的路由、Skill 、恢复、连接和环境检查不重复执行；仅在会话、环境或关键前提实际变化时重检。* 达到最小验收条件立即停止；相邻问题最多一句提示，不自动处理。 10 nobject 21h 24m ago 兜底代码太多了。连从 db 中查出来的实体都要再用是否为 nil 和 id 是否为空再做一层判断 11 HKzy 21h 22m ago 改用 grok 吧，甚至可以和它对喷 13 aqx 21h 20m ago via Android 好像所有 ai 都有这个问题 15 Dengddd 21h 10m ago 每次一个小改动都一大堆测试，好多时间花费在测试上 16 vfs 21h 8m ago 2 @aqx 我甚至感觉最新的 deepseek flash 都有这种问题，也不知道是不是我用的 reasonix 导致的。 17 yuxi521 21h 1m ago gpt 确实老登味太重了。claude 这点就好很多。简单直接。 18 wowh 20h 40m ago codex 里的 gpt5.6 一点都不啰嗦啊，都是蒙头干活 20 nexuszjq 20h 32m ago 5.6 已经改善不少了，5.4 那会儿真是又啰嗦又不说人话，一气之下退订 gpt 转订 cc 21 xfn 20h 28m ago 如果比起 opus 5 ，我甚至觉得 gpt 还挺拟人。opus 5 不光啰嗦，还看不懂，不知道用的什么语料训练的，说话莫名其妙的转折、递进，时不时冒些行话、黑话、俚语，还觉得自己挺幽默 22 qinqiuxu 20h 27m ago 特别啰嗦，就说 chatGPT ，回复时一直换行，随便一个名词和一句代码行都用代码块而不是行内代码，大量使用列表，导致回复在纵向上特别长，横向宽度很窄，阅读中断感很强，要一直翻页。 23 pipiking 20h 26m ago 就是回答又臭又长，重点核心就几句话写八百行，沟通没以前高效。但感觉现在 AI 好像很多都这样 24 yaaaaaak 20h 25m ago via iPhone 最近感觉明显降智。日常用 sol high ，大多数时候抓着边边角角不放，必须下死命令，核心代码却写得越来越敷衍。 25 GeruzoniAnsasu 20h 24m ago 7 你的直觉非常正确。GPT 现在的模型，不知道是为了追求`严谨`还是为了遵循奇怪的“结构化指令”回复的句式可谓是比「现代派」装逼诗人还要「零碎」感觉像是训练为拟合某类任务导致文本处理能力变得极度**反人类** 26 someonelikeyouah 20h 13m ago cc 不啰嗦 但是他会漏掉一些边缘的东西，指哪里打哪里，你漏了他就漏了，gpt 就是啰嗦 但是逻辑性稍微差点，感觉是设定问题 29 DICK23 20h 4m ago 这两天的 5.6SOL Max 感觉很利索啊，话不多，速度也快，框框干 32 Anarchy 19h 56m ago 网页版非常啰唆，可以个性化设置里改成“高效务实”能稍微改善下，就算这么设置其实还是比 Codex 里的啰唆些。感觉 GPT 就是非常怕自己漏逻辑，防御性话术一大堆。光是这样也还好吧因为本身自己就没说明要不要严禁的看待这个问题，令人暴躁的是就算说了不用重复边边角角的细节，不用纠正我的不严谨用语，GPT 是一句话都听不进去依然我行我素。 33 Changniac 19h 41m ago 把一件鸡毛蒜皮的问题，扩写成完全正确的逻辑再重新讲，是做 ld 的最重要基本功，笔杆子能力。 35 wclebb 19h 21m ago Work 模式好多了。 36 superhero007 19h 14m ago 非常非常啰嗦，我开了一个月 plus 就没再用了。当时全部都在说 5.5 比肩 claude ，量还大，但我自己用起来非常难受。 37 Yuan24 18h 56m ago 很啰嗦，我目前最喜欢的是 opus 4.6 ，言简意赅 38 Tory12138 18h 55m ago Gemini 也是，莫名其妙把以前的东西老翻出来说，比如说我问他一下新问题，它非要扯到这和以前的什么什么一样的，感觉有点显摆它的记忆力一样的 40 bytesfold 17h 54m ago via iPhone 200 刀套餐都不咋愿意用，主要用网页 pro 帮我系统分析问题+ultra 模式扫描代码库 41 C0VN 17h 44m ago 是的，所以最近半年基本就没用过了，我说的是我只用过网页免费的版本。 42 lujiaosama 17h 36m ago 落到 SPEC 文档上，也是又臭又长，还容易过度设计。 45 pan10 13h 17m ago 防御性编程 47 CL7 13h 3m ago 是的，最开始 3.5 出来的时候，能力比较弱，就会说很多，后面到了 4 感觉好多了，然后降智又开始啰嗦 49 way2explore2 12h 24m ago 试试这个···Terse = shortest clear answer that preserves technical accuracy.Use these rules for every response unless user asks for a diagram or chart.## Core- Lead with most important answer or result- Use short section headers- Use one point per line, no full stop at line end- Skip pleasantries, preamble, summaries, filler, and hedging- After tools, report facts only: \"12% of requests failed\", not \"an issue may have impacted users\"··· 50 EDD 10h 32m ago 最让人抓狂的是说话像个朦胧诗人一样，两三个字一行，不停断句，不停回车不过还好，直接把这个问题指出给他之后，马上就修正了，虽然后面偶尔还会有这样的行文范式，但主体的显示结构有调整，比较正常了些。 52 wolfie 9h 36m ago 没错5.6 的指令依从度高了很多，废话少了。 54 loading 9h 15m ago via Android 兜底=啰嗦放开=傻逼 55 LazySheep 8h 2m ago 试试 Grok 内置的 Concise 模式：Respond briefly and directly, using as few words as possible. Focus on the core point without elaboration or follow-up questions. 56 win8en 6h 35m ago via Android @Dengddd 一模一样，我现在小问题都是用 antigravity 了 57 codeugar 6h 30m ago 又臭又长、容易钻牛角尖，然后花大量上下文，忽略全局，怎么形容呢？就是一个很努力的神经病。 58 zhuyananbusiness 5h 2m ago 我有一个观察：啰嗦很多时候不是模型不想简洁，而是它在前几个 token 就决定了“要严谨、要兜底”的生成策略，之后的展开只是在执行这个决定。与其在每条消息里反复叮嘱“别啰嗦”，不如把约束写进长期记忆或系统层，让它每轮都生效。实际对我有效的是两条：一是给一个明确的输出模板（比如“先给结论一句话，再给最小必要步骤”），模型有模板可循就不容易自由发挥；二是把“不要预防性兜底、除非真实报错”这类话写进项目级指令，效果比每次临时强调稳定得多。另外换模型确实有差异，但同模型下把这些写进长期上下文，比反复纠正省心很多。 59 Acegik OP 4h 13m ago @Chicagoake 我也觉得 gemini 的 chat 很好，但 google 非要和两家争 coding 能力，这下核心人物又走了几个，不知道 gemini 未来何去何从了 60 ErYiii 2h 19m ago ● 不要保留向后兼容性。移除过时的路径，而不是添加兼容层、回退机制或迁移方案。● 选择能完全满足当前需求的最简单实现。避免推测性的抽象、配置和间接层。● 分层构建系统。从最小的端到端可运行版本开始，在已经可用的产品基础上添加每一项新功能。绝不要用未完成且复杂的方案替换现有的可用产品。● 保持组件模块化，并清晰分离关注点。● 当成熟且维护良好的库能降低整体复杂度或提高可靠性时，优先使用它们。如果没有明确理由，不要重新实现通用功能。● 在编写自己的实现或添加新包之前，先充分利用项目中已有的依赖项。在未查阅文档和类型定义之前，不要假设某个库缺乏特定功能。● 架构决策要着眼长远。不要接受仅适用于当下且计划日后替换的权宜之计。","fetched_at":"2026-08-05T22:27:11.712Z","ok":true}